talk to me in two different languages.


01:00:05.810 --> 01:00:10.873
lt makes me feel schizometric.
Schizo-- Schizo--


01:00:15.887 --> 01:00:19.323
Schizophrenic.
That's the word you're looking for.


01:00:19.490 --> 01:00:22.186
-Yeah.
-Hey, don't pay attention to those losers.


01:00:22.360 --> 01:00:25.330
Try to be more on time
in the morning. They'll leave you alone.


01:00:25.864 --> 01:00:27.855
No, no, no.


01:00:28.434 --> 01:00:30.595
NPC's for film.


01:00:30.769 --> 01:00:33.465
CPN goes with CPP.


01:00:44.083 --> 01:00:45.573
CPP.


01:00:45.751 --> 01:00:49.949
