01:00:50.756 --> 01:00:52.849
You know the....


01:00:53.025 --> 01:00:55.084
The goat on the cliff?


01:00:55.260 --> 01:00:57.388
-The goat on the cliff?
-Goat on the cliff. No?


01:00:57.564 --> 01:01:00.658
