01:01:27.859 --> 01:01:29.885
A pair of shoes.


01:01:32.665 --> 01:01:34.690
Some glasses.


01:01:36.936 --> 01:01:38.995
Telephone.


01:01:40.073 --> 01:01:42.041
Typewriter.


01:01:42.208 --> 01:01:43.971
