take the red blanket as well?


01:01:58.591 --> 01:02:00.354
Of course, Stéphane. Are you kidding?


01:02:00.526 --> 01:02:02.620
There's this amazing blanket.


01:02:02.796 --> 01:02:06.732
It's thick, red felt
with big white stitches.


01:02:06.900 --> 01:02:08.891
Wild animals are running on it.


01:02:19.713 --> 01:02:21.681
