01:06:11.652 --> 01:06:14.746
Distraction is an obstruction
to the construction.


01:06:14.922 --> 01:06:17.322
Distraction is an obstruction
for the construction.


01:06:18.792 --> 01:06:21.421
Distraction is an obstruction
for the construction.


01:06:44.920 --> 01:06:46.979
