-Good.
-Hey, you take the glue gun, and l'll try this.


01:10:10.198 --> 01:10:11.426
No, no, no.


01:10:11.600 --> 01:10:13.500
Why don't we,
why don't we do the scene...


01:10:13.668 --> 01:10:16.034
