01:10:18.373 --> 01:10:19.601
-Yeah. Okay.
-Yeah?


01:10:19.774 --> 01:10:22.299
Okay. So come, come, come.


01:10:22.477 --> 01:10:25.537
You must be.... Okay. Yeah, there.


01:10:26.281 --> 01:10:28.749
-Oh, wait.
-All right, okay, you're there.


01:10:28.917 --> 01:10:31.943
So basically you're just
walking into the apartment...


01:10:32.120 --> 01:10:34.418
...and you discover
that the pony can run...


01:10:34.589 --> 01:10:37.786
...and you feel very excited, and....


01:10:37.959 --> 01:10:40.929
Ready? And action.


01:10:41.130 --> 01:10:43.496
Damn it, Stéphane,
you've ruined my pony.


01:10:43.666 --> 01:10:47.363
-Why did you do that?
-Cut. What are you doing?


01:10:47.537 --> 01:10:49.368
What are you doing?
What are you doing?


