No, you should be ecstatic about me.


01:10:51.607 --> 01:10:55.236
You should be, like,
praising my ingénue and genius.


01:10:55.411 --> 01:10:57.777
Of course, my handsome.


01:10:58.080 --> 01:11:00.878
No, don't play with me.
This is never gonna happen.


01:11:01.050 --> 01:11:03.018
-How do you know?
-Because l know.


01:11:03.186 --> 01:11:05.086
Why are you trying
to give me hope?


01:11:05.254 --> 01:11:08.155
Hope? Maybe you should try.


01:11:08.324 --> 01:11:09.689
Try.


01:11:09.859 --> 01:11:12.555
Well, next time l'll see you,
