01:12:41.887 --> 01:12:45.755
Listen, Stéphane.
You have to toughen up a little.


01:12:46.325 --> 01:12:49.817
lt's not attractive for a girl
to see a guy crying.


01:12:49.996 --> 01:12:51.691
