for a little while?


01:14:12.080 --> 01:14:15.777
Because l always thought
it was possible to talk from my sleep.


01:14:15.951 --> 01:14:18.943
l feel that l'm falling down
into a black hole.


01:14:19.755 --> 01:14:23.316
You know that you could never see
someone fall in a black hole.


01:14:23.492 --> 01:14:26.655
Because the image of the traveler
who passes the horizon...


01:14:26.828 --> 01:14:31.493
