stuck in the same position...


01:14:31.667 --> 01:14:34.067
The state he was
when he crossed the line.


01:14:34.237 --> 01:14:36.603
Only it's getting redder.


01:14:36.773 --> 01:14:40.800
The traveler gets crushed into spaghetti.


01:14:41.244 --> 01:14:44.441
I don't wanna be a spaghetti,
I don't wanna be spaghetti.


01:14:44.614 --> 01:14:46.172
No, you won't be a spaghetti.


01:14:46.349 --> 01:14:47.714
I don't wanna be a spaghetti.


01:14:47.884 --> 01:14:50.148
Stéphane?


01:14:51.287 --> 01:14:54.723
-Are you here?
-No, I'm there! I'm there.


01:14:54.891 --> 01:14:57.917
It worked! I'm not a spaghetti!


01:14:58.094 --> 01:15:01.223
Tell me, tell me. Describe all you can see.


01:15:01.398 --> 01:15:03.298
I feel some grass under my feet.


01:15:03.467 --> 01:15:05.298
And it's a bit windy.


01:15:05.469 --> 01:15:08.802
And cold. And damp.


01:15:08.972 --> 01:15:11.839
And there's forest all around me.


01:15:12.743 --> 01:15:16.372
And l can see Golden the Pony Boy.
Galloping here. Here, right in front of me.


01:15:16.547 --> 01:15:20.313
And I can hear some water.
But I cannot see it.


01:15:21.819 --> 01:15:23.844
Oh, here it is. The river.


01:15:24.021 --> 01:15:27.650
ls the water made of millions
of tiny pieces of cellophane?


01:15:27.825 --> 01:15:29.918
No, it's real water.


01:15:30.093 --> 01:15:32.756
Oh, look. l just found the time machine.


01:15:32.931 --> 01:15:34.956
The time machine is here.


01:15:41.139 --> 01:15:43.232
And it works.


01:15:48.580 --> 01:15:51.845
Stéphane, are you asleep?


01:15:53.485 --> 01:15:55.350
Stéphanie, you know my mom, Christine.


01:15:55.520 --> 01:15:56.817
two months later


01:16:00.525 --> 01:16:03.085
Yeah, l cannot talk French
because whenever l speak...


01:16:03.261 --> 01:16:06.754
...l feel that my moustache grows
more than when l speak Spanish.


01:16:06.932 --> 01:16:08.797
Stéphanie.


01:17:16.203 --> 01:17:17.693
l....


01:17:19.807 --> 01:17:22.776
l wanna dedicate this
to all the victims....


01:17:22.944 --> 01:17:25.003
Okay, thank you, Mr. Miroux.


01:17:25.179 --> 01:17:30.276
Without them, without them,
it would not have been possible.


01:18:16.899 --> 01:18:19.231
l'm sorry. Are you upset?


01:18:51.135 --> 01:18:54.571
This girl is at once all the women
that broke my heart.


01:18:54.738 --> 01:18:58.902
She's so beautiful and generous
and she's asking me to leave.


01:18:59.076 --> 01:19:01.101
Because she's dumping me.


01:19:01.278 --> 01:19:04.873
She's dumping me because
I am a cheap drug dealer.


01:19:05.049 --> 01:19:08.041
And I am a drug dealer
because she wants to leave me.


01:19:09.186 --> 01:19:11.416
The police are going to get me now.


01:19:11.588 --> 01:19:13.419
This is all my fault.


01:20:13.152 --> 01:20:15.382
He is my opposite.


01:20:15.721 --> 01:20:17.916
She feels safe around him.


01:20:19.258 --> 01:20:21.317
She's in love with him.


01:20:49.156 --> 01:20:52.353
Things will turn out the way you want.


01:20:53.426 --> 01:20:56.590
lf you could just stop doubting
that l love you.


01:20:57.465 --> 01:21:00.559
Call me home. Next door.


01:22:23.786 --> 01:22:25.253
lt's not fair.


01:22:25.421 --> 01:22:28.549
She changed exactly the second
